WEBVTT

00:00:19.164 --> 00:00:20.582
Yep!

00:00:28.382 --> 00:00:30.801
Here you go. Open wide.

00:00:36.557 --> 00:00:39.518
Is it yummy?

00:00:39.518 --> 00:00:44.064
Eat a lot so that you’ll grow up healthy.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:10.160
Absent-minded, I only prayed to the stars

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:15.960
Losing sight of all that was precious

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:20.800
Absent-minded, I kept my eyes fixed on the same spot

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:26.510
And came to a standstill myself

00:01:28.430 --> 00:01:31.680
We don't need no reasons

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:36.770
To change for the better

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:44.070
Now, let's dream to the extreme

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:46.160
You're a shooting star

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:49.450
Kick open the doors that stand in your way

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:54.670
And leap beyond the infinite horizon

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:56.750
Light on the shooting star

00:01:56.750 --> 00:02:02.760
Don't look back; what you seek is in front of you

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:05.880
Let's go in search of it

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:10.640
Fly away

00:02:23.455 --> 00:02:26.458
U-Uhm…

00:02:26.458 --> 00:02:33.048
I’ve been praying all this time.
You came to make my wish come true.

00:02:33.048 --> 00:02:36.176
So, my cute angel, what’s your name?

00:02:36.176 --> 00:02:38.595
Leop…

00:02:38.595 --> 00:02:41.640
I mean, D-Doronjo!

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:44.393
Nice to meet you, Doronjo.

00:02:44.393 --> 00:02:46.436
My angel!

00:02:53.944 --> 00:02:55.904
You have a pretty face.

00:02:55.904 --> 00:02:58.490
I'm numb…!

00:03:00.492 --> 00:03:04.705
I'm Boyacky, Miss Doronjo’s sexy attendant.

00:03:04.705 --> 00:03:07.124
Nice to meet you, Mr. Boyacky.

00:03:07.124 --> 00:03:10.752
Likewise, Miss… eh…

00:03:10.752 --> 00:03:12.796
I'm Alouette.

00:03:12.796 --> 00:03:16.550
Miss Alouette. You can touch me more.

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:22.014
Well, my ancestor was a character
like that, so I'm just taking on his role.

00:03:22.014 --> 00:03:23.765
It’s definitely not because
I have an ulterior motive.

00:03:23.765 --> 00:03:25.684
You’re strong!

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:28.687
I'm Tonzra.

00:03:28.687 --> 00:03:30.981
Okay, Mr. Tonzra.

00:03:34.276 --> 00:03:37.029
And you are a little piggy.

00:03:39.322 --> 00:03:42.909
I’m so happy that my angel came to see me.

00:03:45.454 --> 00:03:48.040
U-Uhm… We’re not ange--

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:54.212
Miss Doronjo. If we pretend to be angels,
maybe she won’t report us.

00:03:54.212 --> 00:03:57.007
But… lying is wrong.

00:03:57.007 --> 00:04:00.469
Miss Alouette is the one
who mistook us for angels.

00:04:00.469 --> 00:04:03.388
We didn’t correct her, that’s all.

00:04:03.388 --> 00:04:05.390
It’s not a lie, right?

00:04:06.349 --> 00:04:07.726
Well then, it can’t be helped.

00:04:07.726 --> 00:04:10.812
Right, it can’t be helped.

00:04:13.482 --> 00:04:16.401
Little piggy, you’re hungry, aren’t you?

00:04:21.656 --> 00:04:26.536
I’ll go warm up the soup.
Hold on a minute, okay?

00:04:26.536 --> 00:04:30.248
Ah…! Mom! I’ll help you!

00:04:30.248 --> 00:04:31.416
"Mom"…

00:04:31.416 --> 00:04:33.210
She isn’t her mom.

00:04:34.753 --> 00:04:38.423
But I like that girl.

00:04:38.423 --> 00:04:40.759
I do, too.

00:04:54.606 --> 00:04:56.858
She really resembles Mom.

00:04:58.944 --> 00:05:01.279
Doronjo, could you get some bowls?

00:05:01.279 --> 00:05:03.323
O-Okay.

00:05:04.449 --> 00:05:06.952
Gatchan’s back.

00:05:06.952 --> 00:05:08.995
I’ll go check!

00:05:08.995 --> 00:05:10.372
What happened?!

00:05:10.372 --> 00:05:12.958
Miss Doronjo! It’s a thief!

00:05:12.958 --> 00:05:15.210
I’m not a thief!

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:16.670
You’re suspicious!

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:18.505
You guys are the suspicious ones!

00:05:18.505 --> 00:05:22.259
You must be after Alouette… y-you pervs!

00:05:24.219 --> 00:05:25.220
True…

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:27.848
L-Let go of me, you perv!

00:05:27.848 --> 00:05:30.058
I’ll protect Ally!

00:05:30.058 --> 00:05:31.685
Let go of me!

00:05:32.686 --> 00:05:34.437
Who are you?

00:05:35.981 --> 00:05:39.442
I’m Galina. Ally and I grew up together.

00:05:39.442 --> 00:05:40.986
What do we do?

00:05:40.986 --> 00:05:42.821
Let go of him.

00:05:44.406 --> 00:05:47.367
Ally! Alouette!

00:05:47.367 --> 00:05:49.327
Sh-She’s okay.

00:05:49.327 --> 00:05:51.705
Gatchan, please take the bowls to the table.

00:05:51.705 --> 00:05:52.998
Ally?!

00:05:52.998 --> 00:05:58.336
I warmed up the soup.
The angels are hungry, so…

00:05:58.336 --> 00:06:00.172
Angels?

00:06:02.841 --> 00:06:06.094
You’re mistaken. They’re pervs.

00:06:06.094 --> 00:06:10.432
The angels came to make my wish come true.

00:06:16.229 --> 00:06:19.024
We need to ask some questions!
Open the door!

00:06:19.024 --> 00:06:22.527
It’s them!

00:06:22.527 --> 00:06:24.696
Miss Doronjo! Please come in here!

00:06:28.533 --> 00:06:29.534
Open the door!

00:06:29.534 --> 00:06:36.208
R-Right away!

00:06:36.208 --> 00:06:39.377
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:39.377 --> 00:06:40.879
Yatterman!

00:06:40.879 --> 00:06:43.131
Y-Yatterman!

00:06:43.131 --> 00:06:45.675
Have you seen suspicious people?

00:06:45.675 --> 00:06:52.432
Three people who call themselves
Doronjo, Boyacky, and Tonzra, and also a pig.

00:06:52.432 --> 00:06:55.143
What did they do?

00:06:55.143 --> 00:06:59.356
They destroyed some of
our fellow soldiers and escaped.

00:06:59.356 --> 00:07:01.149
What…?

00:07:01.149 --> 00:07:02.817
We’ll check inside the house.

00:07:02.817 --> 00:07:05.737
H-Hey, please wait!

00:07:10.075 --> 00:07:14.579
I’ll tell them if it’s an odd number.
If it’s an even number…

00:07:14.579 --> 00:07:16.706
We’re coming in!

00:07:16.706 --> 00:07:17.916
Okay.

00:07:21.044 --> 00:07:22.379
Hey, you.

00:07:22.379 --> 00:07:24.214
Do you know anything about those people?

00:07:24.214 --> 00:07:25.882
Yep, I do!

00:07:25.882 --> 00:07:27.759
What?!

00:07:27.759 --> 00:07:29.344
The angels.

00:07:29.344 --> 00:07:30.720
What? A-Angels?

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:35.767
The angels came to make my wish come true.

00:07:35.767 --> 00:07:38.645
I-If you see suspicious guys, report it to us!

00:07:38.645 --> 00:07:41.273
W-Will do.

00:07:41.273 --> 00:07:42.649
What are those?

00:07:42.649 --> 00:07:44.693
Hm?

00:07:44.693 --> 00:07:47.529
I-I don’t need these clothes anymore since
they’re tattered,

00:07:47.529 --> 00:07:50.031
so I thought l’d feed them to the flames.

00:07:50.031 --> 00:07:53.618
See? They’re like garbage, right?

00:07:56.788 --> 00:07:58.456
I see…

00:07:59.749 --> 00:08:01.668
Yatterman!

00:08:10.635 --> 00:08:13.096
You’re okay now.

00:08:13.096 --> 00:08:15.724
Uhm…

00:08:15.724 --> 00:08:18.643
Now, let’s have soup!

00:08:18.643 --> 00:08:22.981
Before that… we need some clothes.

00:08:22.981 --> 00:08:24.691
Sorry.

00:08:32.157 --> 00:08:37.078
Galina, why did you hide us from them?

00:08:41.666 --> 00:08:47.839
My mom and dad… as well
as Alouette’s mom and dad…

00:08:47.839 --> 00:08:51.051
They were all killed by Yatterman.

00:08:52.886 --> 00:08:57.057
Those clothes are Ally’s and her dad’s.

00:08:57.974 --> 00:09:03.521
They were forcibly taken to Yatter Metropolis.

00:09:03.521 --> 00:09:06.274
Yatter Metropolis?

00:09:06.274 --> 00:09:09.319
It’s the capital city of Yatter Kingdom

00:09:09.319 --> 00:09:11.529
that is at Cape Of-Course-lt’s-So-Ya
at its north end.

00:09:11.529 --> 00:09:13.865
Cape Of-Course-lt’s-So-Ya…

00:09:13.865 --> 00:09:16.201
Her dog was taken, too.

00:09:16.201 --> 00:09:18.912
They were forced to work there day and night.

00:09:18.912 --> 00:09:22.707
They all died in an explosion at the factory.

00:09:24.667 --> 00:09:30.840
What came back was a small amount
of money and some pieces of bones.

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:34.302
Ally hasn’t been able to accept that reality.

00:09:34.302 --> 00:09:39.432
She keeps dreaming
instead of facing the reality.

00:09:39.432 --> 00:09:41.518
She keeps crying, saying that

00:09:41.518 --> 00:09:47.690
one day an angel will come
and let her see her parents and dog.

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:55.907
And then, you guys came and,
for the first time in a long while… she smiled.

00:09:55.907 --> 00:09:58.410
I won’t report you guys,

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:02.580
but I want you to leave as soon as possible.

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:06.167
If the Yatter soldiers
find out that you’re here,

00:10:06.167 --> 00:10:11.089
Ally will also be dragged
into your mess. So… So, please!

00:10:11.089 --> 00:10:15.218
I don’t want to put her in danger!

00:10:15.218 --> 00:10:18.888
Okay. We’ll leave in the morning.

00:10:18.888 --> 00:10:19.931
Got that, guys?

00:10:19.931 --> 00:10:20.932
Yes.

00:10:20.932 --> 00:10:22.434
Thank you.

00:10:25.437 --> 00:10:28.773
The bath is ready!

00:10:28.773 --> 00:10:31.776
Let’s take a bath together, angel!

00:10:34.112 --> 00:10:35.655
What?

00:10:43.288 --> 00:10:48.126
I like that song. What’s it called?

00:10:49.544 --> 00:10:54.132
I don’t know. My mom used to sing it for me.

00:10:54.132 --> 00:10:58.553
She said she learned it from her mom, too.

00:10:58.553 --> 00:11:02.223
I love this song, too.

00:11:02.223 --> 00:11:05.560
Say, sing it again.

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:07.145
Sure!

00:11:28.408 --> 00:11:31.327
Sorry, but you’ll have to sleep here.

00:11:31.327 --> 00:11:32.912
What about you?

00:11:32.912 --> 00:11:38.084
I’ll be in the living room…
since I'm concerned about Alouette.

00:11:38.084 --> 00:11:39.544
I see.

00:11:39.544 --> 00:11:41.796
Amazing…

00:11:41.796 --> 00:11:43.798
Done.

00:11:43.798 --> 00:11:45.258
What’s that?

00:11:45.258 --> 00:11:50.096
It’s an alarm clock.
We’ll leave early in the morning, so…

00:11:50.096 --> 00:11:54.016
I used what I found on
the floor here to make it.

00:11:54.016 --> 00:11:56.436
Whoa…

00:11:56.436 --> 00:11:58.938
Well then, good night.

00:12:03.609 --> 00:12:07.113
Why do you hate Yatterman?

00:12:09.615 --> 00:12:11.534
If you don’t want to talk about it…

00:12:14.579 --> 00:12:17.665
We couldn’t protect
someone we cared about a lot.

00:12:17.665 --> 00:12:19.917
We’re making up for it.

00:12:21.294 --> 00:12:23.296
Good night.

00:12:32.805 --> 00:12:37.185
Couldn’t protect someone
they cared about a lot…

00:13:12.178 --> 00:13:14.096
Thank you for everything.

00:13:14.096 --> 00:13:16.849
Please give our regards to Miss Alouette.

00:13:16.849 --> 00:13:20.394
Please tell her that the soup was really good.

00:13:20.394 --> 00:13:26.526
Uhm… Here… I made clothes
for you… since I burned yours.

00:13:26.526 --> 00:13:29.362
You took the trouble to make them for us?!

00:13:29.362 --> 00:13:34.033
I make Ally’s clothes as a hobby.
I like doing things that require precision, so…

00:13:34.033 --> 00:13:36.452
Thank you, Galina!

00:13:36.452 --> 00:13:38.204
Where are you headed now?

00:13:38.204 --> 00:13:41.541
We’re going to the
capital city, Yatter Metropolis!

00:13:41.541 --> 00:13:44.335
Are you really going there to
give Yatterman a forehead flicking?

00:13:44.335 --> 00:13:48.172
Of course! We have to punish them.

00:13:49.715 --> 00:13:52.134
I see…

00:13:52.134 --> 00:13:53.177
Uhm…

00:13:53.177 --> 00:13:54.595
Hm?

00:13:54.595 --> 00:13:58.099
Uhm… hold on a sec.

00:14:02.186 --> 00:14:04.897
No, never mind.

00:14:04.897 --> 00:14:06.774
Take care.

00:14:17.743 --> 00:14:19.745
Boyacky…

00:14:23.749 --> 00:14:26.085
Let’s go!

00:14:26.085 --> 00:14:27.878
She isn’t my mom!

00:14:30.464 --> 00:14:33.551
We’re moving forward!

00:14:43.811 --> 00:14:48.107
Where’s my angel, Doronjo?

00:14:49.775 --> 00:14:52.820
They are…

00:14:58.618 --> 00:15:03.623
I know! They’re getting my mom and dad!

00:15:03.623 --> 00:15:05.791
They’re not coming back.

00:15:05.791 --> 00:15:07.543
What?

00:15:07.543 --> 00:15:10.713
Your mom and dad… have both gone…

00:15:10.713 --> 00:15:13.466
…to a place they can’t come back from.

00:15:13.466 --> 00:15:15.134
Alouette!

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:20.348
Ally… please listen to me!

00:15:22.308 --> 00:15:24.602
They’re not ange--!

00:15:24.602 --> 00:15:28.272
Where… are they?

00:15:44.955 --> 00:15:48.501
lt flew in the opposite direction from us.

00:15:48.501 --> 00:15:51.796
And that scream was…

00:15:51.796 --> 00:15:55.299
You guys, take a look inside of the bag.

00:16:18.364 --> 00:16:23.536
You hid Doronjo and the others and
went against us. That’s a serious crime!

00:16:23.536 --> 00:16:25.121
--Tell us where they are!
--Ally!

00:16:25.121 --> 00:16:26.580
Ahh… what should I do?

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:32.211
Or we’ll send you and
your puny house into oblivion!

00:16:32.211 --> 00:16:33.337
I’ll give you thirty seconds.

00:16:33.337 --> 00:16:37.675
--Thirty seconds?!
--One! Two! Three! Four! Five!

00:16:37.675 --> 00:16:41.887
--Alouette! Hurry! Go to the basement!
--Six! Seven! Eight! Nine!

00:16:41.887 --> 00:16:43.723
--Doronjo…
--Ten! Eleven…!

00:16:43.723 --> 00:16:44.890
Ally!

00:16:44.890 --> 00:16:48.894
Seventeen! Eighteen! Nineteen! Twenty!

00:16:48.894 --> 00:16:51.897
--Ally! We have to hurry or…
--Twenty-one! Twenty-two! Twenty-three!

00:16:51.897 --> 00:16:55.860
Twenty-four! Twenty-five!
Twenty-six! Twenty-seven!

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:59.739
Twenty-eight! Twenty-nine! Thirty!

00:16:59.739 --> 00:17:01.323
Fi--

00:17:01.323 --> 00:17:02.867
Hm?

00:17:10.291 --> 00:17:12.585
That’s the pig on the wanted list! After him!

00:17:16.922 --> 00:17:19.550
Alouette! Galina!

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:21.260
Y-You came back?

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:23.429
Of course! We couldn’t just leave you alone!

00:17:23.429 --> 00:17:25.598
Right, guys?!

00:17:25.598 --> 00:17:26.807
Right!

00:17:28.434 --> 00:17:30.728
Yes, ma’am!

00:17:32.605 --> 00:17:38.569
Please don’t leave
me again, Doronjo… my angel!

00:17:38.569 --> 00:17:40.029
I won’t!

00:17:42.948 --> 00:17:44.950
Hurry! Head to the basement!

00:17:48.204 --> 00:17:51.207
D-Do you have a plan?

00:17:51.207 --> 00:17:55.377
Don’t lose heart!
You want to protect Alouette, right?!

00:17:55.961 --> 00:17:56.587
But…

00:17:56.587 --> 00:17:58.464
No buts!

00:17:58.464 --> 00:18:00.966
Who do you think we are?!

00:18:00.966 --> 00:18:03.427
We are the world-famous Doronbow!

00:18:03.427 --> 00:18:08.599
We’ll wear the clothes you made and fight!

00:18:08.599 --> 00:18:10.684
We’ll protect you two!

00:18:14.021 --> 00:18:15.606
Uhm…

00:18:15.606 --> 00:18:16.899
What is it?

00:18:19.485 --> 00:18:21.654
If it’s an even number…

00:18:24.824 --> 00:18:29.578
No… This is something I need to decide myself!

00:18:29.578 --> 00:18:31.330
Now, we’ll finish it off.

00:18:33.833 --> 00:18:36.710
Take us with you!

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:39.797
I want to give Yatterman
a forehead flicking, too!

00:18:39.797 --> 00:18:43.217
So yes, please use those clothes!

00:18:43.217 --> 00:18:47.847
If I'm with you, I’ll be able to do it!

00:18:47.847 --> 00:18:51.809
For our parents… and more importantly…

00:18:54.395 --> 00:19:00.025
Ally! Let’s go with the angels!
To the place where your mom and dad are!

00:19:00.025 --> 00:19:01.318
Together with them?!

00:19:01.318 --> 00:19:03.112
That’s right!

00:19:03.112 --> 00:19:06.156
Yep!

00:19:06.156 --> 00:19:10.661
I guess it can’t be helped… Suit yourself!

00:19:13.372 --> 00:19:15.207
Fire!

00:19:40.608 --> 00:19:45.738
Your justice isn’t true justice!

00:19:49.241 --> 00:19:52.536
Be pure! Be right! Be beautiful!

00:19:52.536 --> 00:19:55.164
As long as Doronbow exists,

00:19:55.164 --> 00:19:59.376
Yatterman will have no place in this world!

00:19:59.376 --> 00:20:05.341
We’ll drive the darkness away
and bring a new dawn to this world!

00:20:07.927 --> 00:20:09.720
Wha…?!

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:11.305
And, <i>click.</i>

00:20:20.272 --> 00:20:22.441
Give them hell!

00:20:28.155 --> 00:20:32.284
Even a pig will climb a
tree when flattered. Oink!

00:20:32.284 --> 00:20:33.953
What’s this?

00:20:33.953 --> 00:20:38.832
Whatever you do, you should always
keep your sense of humor, Miss Doronjo.

00:20:38.832 --> 00:20:40.584
I see!

00:20:41.877 --> 00:20:44.755
I-Is it okay to fire at it?

00:20:44.755 --> 00:20:46.298
What should we do?!

00:20:46.298 --> 00:20:47.383
You try shooting at it.

00:20:47.383 --> 00:20:49.635
Me…?

00:20:49.635 --> 00:20:53.931
It’s amazing that you built this…
but can we win?

00:20:53.931 --> 00:20:55.474
We don’t have to win!

00:20:55.474 --> 00:20:56.767
What?

00:20:56.767 --> 00:21:00.521
For now, as long as we don’t
get defeated, that’s all that matters!

00:21:00.521 --> 00:21:03.065
Get out of here, oink!

00:21:30.843 --> 00:21:35.973
Yo-ho… Yo-ho… Yo-ho… See ya!

00:21:40.894 --> 00:21:43.397
Ally, are you okay?

00:21:43.397 --> 00:21:46.025
The wind feels good!

00:21:48.652 --> 00:21:52.489
Now, we’re gonna hurry to the
capital city, Yatter Metropolis!

00:21:52.489 --> 00:21:55.075
Yes, ma’am!

00:21:55.075 --> 00:21:58.203
Just wait, Yatterman!

00:22:02.124 --> 00:22:04.543
Ahhhhh! Crap! Crap!

00:22:04.543 --> 00:22:06.712
We’re falling! We’re falling!

00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:18.090
Should I raise my RPM and dream?

00:22:20.300 --> 00:22:25.720
Don't put it off for tomorrow, do it now

00:22:25.720 --> 00:22:28.020
My strong heart wants to get started

00:22:28.020 --> 00:22:30.100
I want to see change, so let's go

00:22:29.980 --> 00:22:35.650
I'm running too fast to smell the roses

